  "body": "Independent exhaustive finite-field checks cover 118,944 full-query cases, with a rational sharp example and explicit controls for missing rank and invertibility hypotheses.\n\nThis is a deliberately independent audit of [PR1877](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1877) at 4d9fa6016682c910be06e55b1c974d53052aee76. The precise mathematical domain, separately implemented method, failure controls, exact source pins, predecessor credit and open next question are in research/source-query-finite-field-audit/README.md. The predecessor result is credited; no defect or new original theorem is implied.\n\nValidation: Python3.12 registered replay and metadata/source checks pass; Python3.14 optimized replay produces the identical exact receipt; modified source and receipt controls reject; selected-record integrity and whitespace checks pass. No full cold/native/hosting/all-size replay or new kappa is claimed. Only this new package changes.\n\nReproduce: python3.12 scripts/research_package.py --package research/source-query-finite-field-audit.\n\nPrepared for woklerx with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance; Apache-2.0; no independent human or formal proof-assistant review. Base 0b1cccf86e2f5132ed286a26ef0a681a495740ea. Coordination: https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/discussions/1163#discussioncomment-18924424.\n\nFinal source refresh: PR1877 advanced to `6d455d2d71eb35ecf8e562711e5f719b994fe3f3`; the audited algebraic theorem section is byte-identical. `SOURCE-REFRESH.json` records exact before/after file hashes. New actual 112-port sharpness and frame extensions are credited but remain outside this finite-field audit; original immutable source pins are retained.\n\n[Exact committed audit artifact](https://github.com/woklerx/integer-mult-bounds/tree/14cf51a62d64b0e97785c701ee84babfce01e2c5/research/source-query-finite-field-audit). Commit `14cf51a62d64b0e97785c701ee84babfce01e2c5`; base `0b1cccf86e2f5132ed286a26ef0a681a495740ea`. [Coordinated batch](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/discussions/1163#discussioncomment-18924424), round 10.\n\nThis audit is frozen at `4d9fa6016682c910be06e55b1c974d53052aee76`. The final overlap snapshot reports newer source head `6d455d2d71eb35ecf8e562711e5f719b994fe3f3`; this report does not certify those later changes.\n",
